# Drum drift (SEQ four times): the patterns change by themselves, a fill the bar before, and mutate.
wait 1500
expect playing 1
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
wait 200
expect view 17
spin K1 1
spin K2 -1
spin K4 2
wait 300
shot drumdrift.png
# Next, every 4 bars, Morph: in 30 s (128 BPM: 1.9 s a bar) four changes or so, each with its mutation
wait 30000
expect dd_changes >2
expect dd_mutations >2
# the knob follows the pattern drift chose
expect pattern_synced 1
# off again: nothing more changes
spin K1 -1
spin K4 -2
wait 2500
expect dd_left -1
